From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Xe Chromium Patches <noreply@xe.invalid>
Date: Sun, 22 Nov 2026 09:33:53 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 6/50] controlledframe: prototype captureStream() for the guest

Adds webViewInternal.getCaptureStreamId(), which registers a one-shot
DesktopStreamsRegistry id (TYPE_WEB_CONTENTS of the guest) bound to the
owning embedder's main frame and origin, and
HTMLControlledFrameElement.captureStream(), which turns it into a
MediaStream via getUserMedia({chromeMediaSource: 'desktop'}).
Experiment.
---
